{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>玄戒O100原型機，為端側大模型而生的高速AI演示終端。採用玄戒O3與O100雙芯協同計算，將傳統手機影像模塊取消、主板全部推翻重製，加入主動風冷散熱系統，最高可支持10瓦功率的超強散熱能力。內置Xiaomi MiMo端側模型，實測可達每秒295 Tokens超高推理速度。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0825/eba83eb7562c76c.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0825/b02885926574d6d.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0825/57209d6aba48e71.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0825/b5692a44095e69a.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0825/eba83eb7562c76c.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0825/b02885926574d6d.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0825/57209d6aba48e71.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T03:00:00.488975+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":7,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}